        [ "Attribute", "default", [ "Object", [] ] ],
        [
          "Attribute",
          "description",
          [
            "Heredoc",
            [
              "DESCRIPTION",
              "\nAPIs for the API Management service. APIs define the operations available to API consumers.\n\n- `display_name` - (Required) The display name of the API.\n- `path` - (Required) The relative path for the API. Must be unique within the API Management service.\n- `protocols` - (Optional) A list of protocols the API supports. Valid values: `http`, `https`, `ws`, `wss`. Defaults to `[\"https\"]`.\n- `revision` - (Optional) The revision number of the API. Defaults to `\"1\"`.\n- `service_url` - (Optional) The backend service URL for the API.\n- `description` - (Optional) Description of the API.\n- `subscription_required` - (Optional) Whether a subscription key is required to access the API. Defaults to `true`.\n\nVersioning:\n- `api_version` - (Optional) The version identifier for the API.\n- `api_version_set_name` - (Optional) The name of the API version set to associate with this API.\n- `revision_description` - (Optional) Description of the API revision.\n\nImport:\n- `import` - (Optional) Import configuration for OpenAPI, WSDL, WADL specifications.\n  - `content_format` - (Required) Format of the content. Valid values: `openapi`, `openapi+json`, `openapi+json-link`, `openapi-link`, `swagger-json`, `swagger-link-json`, `wadl-link-json`, `wadl-xml`, `wsdl`, `wsdl-link`.\n  - `content_value` - (Required) The API definition content or URL.\n  - `wsdl_selector` - (Optional) WSDL selector for SOAP APIs.\n\nOperations:\n- `operations` - (Optional) Map of API operations. Each operation defines an HTTP method and URL template.\n\nPolicies:\n- `policy` - (Optional) API-level policy configuration.\n  - `xml_content` - (Optional) XML policy content.\n  - `xml_link` - (Optional) URL to XML policy content.\n\nExample:\n```terraform\napis = {\n  \"petstore-api\" = {\n    display_name = \"Petstore API\"\n    path         = \"petstore\"\n    protocols    = [\"https\"]\n    service_url  = \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2\"\n\n    operations = {\n      \"get-pets\" = {\n        display_name = \"Get all pets\"\n        method       = \"GET\"\n        url_template = \"/pets\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [ "Attribute", "nullable", [ "Bool", false ] ],
        [
          "Block",
          {
            "type_": "validation",
            "labels": [],
            "body": [
              [
                "Attribute",
                "condition",
                [
                  "Fun_call",
                  [
                    "alltrue",
                    [
                      [
                        "For_tuple",
                        {
                          "identifiers": [ "k", [ "v" ] ],
                          "input": [
                            "Attr",
                            [ [ "Id", "var" ], [ "A_string", "apis" ] ]
                          ],
                          "output": [
                            "Fun_call",
                            [
                              "can",
                              [
                                [
                                  "Fun_call",
                                  [
                                    "regex",
                                    [
                                      [ "String", "^[^*#&+:<>?]+$" ],
                                      [
                                        "Attr",
                                        [
                                          [ "Id", "v" ],
                                          [ "A_string", "path" ]
                                        ]
                                      ]
                                    ]
                                  ]
                                ]
                              ]
                            ]
                          ],
                          "cond": null
                        }
                      ]
                    ]
                  ]
                ]
              ],
              [
                "Attribute",
                "error_message",
                [
                  "String",
                  "API path cannot contain the following characters: *, #, &, +, :, <, >, ?."
                ]
              ]
            ]
          }
        ],
        [
          "Block",
          {
            "type_": "validation",
            "labels": [],
            "body": [
              [
                "Attribute",
                "condition",
                [
                  "Fun_call",
                  [
                    "alltrue",
                    [
                      [
                        "For_tuple",
                        {
                          "identifiers": [ "k", [ "v" ] ],
                          "input": [
                            "Attr",
